<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('layout-partials/head', { title: 'For companies' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('layout-partials/page-bg') %>

  <div class="container">
    <%- include('layout-partials/nav') %>

    <section class="section" style="text-align: center;">
      <p class="eyebrow">For companies</p>
      <h1>Attach a game to anything.</h1>
      <p style="max-width: 560px; margin: 12px auto 0;">A QR code on a card, a parcel, a receipt, a poster by the till. Someone scans it, plays a quick game, and either answers a question or wins a reward. You pick which, and you see every scan.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
      <div class="tiers tiers--three" data-reveal>
        <div class="tier lift">
          <h3>Gift shops &amp; florists</h3>
          <p>The code goes in with the flowers or the box. The recipient plays, answers whatever the sender asked, and the answer emails straight back to them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier lift">
          <h3>Delivery &amp; mail</h3>
          <p>Print it on the letter or the packing slip. The person scans, plays, answers, and the reply lands in your inbox, or the customer's.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier lift">
          <h3>Retail &amp; promos</h3>
          <p>A code by the register or on a flyer. Customers play for a discount: win it for the full deal, lose it for a smaller one. Reusable, no signup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
      <div class="tiers tiers--three" data-reveal>
        <div class="tier lift">
          <h3>Order a batch</h3>
          <p>Pick a game, a difficulty, and how it works. We generate a run of unique QR codes for you to print and attach.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier lift">
          <h3>Question or reward</h3>
          <p>Fixed question, personalized per buyer, or a win/lose reward shown on screen. Your logo and colour on the play screen every way.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier lift">
          <h3>See every scan</h3>
          <p>A dashboard shows codes issued, scanned, played, and answered, so you know it's landing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">Request access</h2>
        <p>Tell us a bit about what you sell. We set companies up by hand for now and send you a dashboard link.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-card" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <form method="POST" action="/api/company-requests">
          <label for="companyName">Company name</label>
          <input type="text" id="companyName" name="companyName" placeholder="e.g. Bloom &amp; Stem" required />

          <label for="contactName">Your name</label>
          <input type="text" id="contactName" name="contactName" placeholder="Who we'll be talking to" required />

          <label for="contactEmail">Your email</label>
          <input type="email" id="contactEmail" name="contactEmail" placeholder="you@company.com" required />

          <label for="sells">What do you sell, and what would the code go on?</label>
          <input type="text" id="sells" name="sells" placeholder="e.g. flower bouquets, tucked in with the wrapping" />

          <label for="volume">Rough volume a month</label>
          <input type="text" id="volume" name="volume" placeholder="e.g. 200 orders, maybe 30 would add this" />

          <label for="message">Anything else</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Occasions you're thinking of, timing, questions."></textarea>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Request access</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('layout-partials/footer') %>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/reveal.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/games/shared.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/emoji-field.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
